002	EXO	028	009	«Marggidiyaa geetettiyaa laa"u shuchchatuwaa ahaade, Israa'eeliyaa naanatuwaa suntsaa unttunttu bolla wooc'aade s'aafa.
002	EXO	028	010	Unttunttu yeletaa maaraadan itti shuchchaa bolla usuppun suntsaa, hinkko shuchchaa bolla k'ay atteeda usuppunatuwaa suntsaa wooc'aade s'aafa.
002	EXO	028	011	Maatafaa bolla suntsaa wooc'iide s'aafiyaawaadan, he laa"u shuchchatuwaa bolla Israa'eeliyaa naanatuwaa suntsaa wooc'aade s'aafa; he shuchchatuwaa work'k'aappe med'd'eedda shuchchaa oyk'k'iyaawaa bolla wotsa.
002	EXO	028	012	Yaataade tammanne laa"u Israa'eeliyaa zeretsaa hassayiyaawaa gidana mala, ha laa"u shuchchatuwaa eefuudiyaanna oytseedda hashiyaa c'ark'k'iyaan wotsa; yaatooppe Med'inaa Godaa sintsan ubbaade k'ofettana mala, ha suntsatuwaa Aaroone bare hashiyaan tookko.
002	EXO	028	013	He shuchchatuwaa oyk'k'iyaawaa work'k'aappe med'd'a.
