003	LEV	007	005	Taman s'uugiide Med'inaa Godaw yarshshiyaa yarshshuwaadan, he shiik'eedda handdaa k'eesii yarshshiyaa sa'aa bollan s'uuggo; hewe naak'uwaa yarshshuwaa.
003	LEV	007	006	K'eesiyaa zare gideedda attuma Asay ubbay he yarshshuwaa ashuwaa mo. He yarshshuu geeshsha yarshshuwaa ubbaappe ittuwaa gidiyaa diraw, geeshsha sa'aan mo.
003	LEV	007	007	«‹Naak'uwaa yarshshuu nagaraa yarshshuwaakka mala; unttunttu laa"uwaa wogay ittuwaa. Hewenne yarshshetteedda mehiyaa ashuu nagaraa atto giissanaw yarshshuwaa yarshsheedda k'eesiyaw imettee.
