003	LEV	007	019	«‹Tunabaa ayaanne bochcheedda ashuu meetettoppo; I taman s'uugettanaw koshshee. Ashuu geeshsha ashuwaa gidooppe, wogaan geeshsha gidiyaa Asay ooninne maana gooppe mo.
