003	LEV	012	001	Med'inaa Goday Musa hawaadan yaageedda;
003	LEV	012	002	«Israa'eeliyaa asaw hawaadan yaagaade oda; ‹Itti mac'c'awuna shahaaraade attuma na'aa yelooppe, bare piilay yeedda wode iza tuna gidiyaawaadankka, hewaadan iza laappun gallassay gakkanaw tuna gidanaanu.
