003	LEV	013	037	Shin k'eesii be'iyaa wode, he k'aac'echchiyaasay aakkibeennawaa gidooppenne karetsa isikiikka Aa bolla doleeddawaa gidooppe, he k'aac'echchiyaasay pas'eedda. He bitaniikka geeshsha gidiyaa diraw, I geeshsha gidiyaawaa k'eesii erisso.
