003	LEV	013	044	he bitanii tumukka wolk'k'aama galbbaa harggii sakkiyaa hargganchcha. I tuna gidiyaa diraw I tuna gidiyaawaa k'eesii erisso; ayaw gooppe harggii Aa huup'iyaan de'ee.
