003	LEV	014	001	Med'inaa Goday Musew hawaadan yaagiide odeedda;
003	LEV	014	002	«Wolk'k'aama galbbaa harggii oyk'k'eedda bitanii geeyiyaa gallassi ootsanaw koshshiyaa wogay hawaa. He bitaniyaa k'eesiyaakko afanaw koshshee.
003	LEV	014	003	K'eesii Asay dunkkaaneedda sa'aappe gas'aa kesiide, Aa harggiyaa be'o. He wode wolk'k'aama galbbaa harggii bitaniyaa bollaappe d'ayeeddawaa gidooppe,
