005	DEU	021	021	Hewaappe guyyiyaan, he kataman de'iyaa attuma Asay ubbay I hayk'k'ana gakkanaw, shuchchaan c'addiide Aa wod'ino. Hewaadan ootsiyaawaan hintte giddoppe iitaa d'ayissite. Yaatooppe Israa'eeliyaa ubbay hewaa sisiide yayana.
