005	DEU	033	028	Hewaa diraw, Israa'eeliyaa asay, bochchiyaawe bayinnan sarotetsaan de'ana; Yaak'ooba pulttuu k'umaynne woyniyaa eessay kumeedda gadiyaan de'ana, saluwaa iray bukkiyaasan de'ana.
