# BOOK	007	JDG	Judges	Daannatuwaa
007	JDG	001	001	Iyyaasu hayk'k'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Israa'eeliyaa asay, «Kanaane gadiyaa asaa olanaw nu zaratuwaappe koyrottiide kesanawe oonee?» yaagiide Med'inaa Godaa oochcheedda.
