013	1CH	005	018	Roobeela zaratuwaappe, Gaade zaratuwaappenne Minaase zaratuwaappe baggatuwaappe olanchchatuu, wolk'k'aamatuu, gonddalliyaanne mashshaa oyk'k'iyaawanttu, wonddaafiyaan dukan looheeddawanttunne olaa salppiyaa eriyaawanttu oytamanne oyddu sha"anne laappun s'eetanne usuppun tamma.
013	1CH	005	019	Unttunttu Aggaaratuwaa yaratuwaanna, Yis'uratuwaana, Naafiishatuwaanne Nodaabatuwaanna oletteeddino.
