013	1CH	015	018	K'ay laa'entso kaalaan Zakkaraasa, Yaa'izi'eela, Shamiraamoota, Yihi'eela, Uunna, Eli'aaba, Banaaya, Ma'iseeya, Matiitiyaa, Elifaala, Miik'ineeyanne penggiyaa naagiyaawantta Obeedi-Eedoomanne Yi'i'eela suntseeddino.
