013	1CH	021	023	Ornni Daawita, «New akka; ta goday kaatii barena nashechchiyaawaa ootso. Be'a, s'uuggiyaa yarshshoo booraa, eetsanaw katsaa bukkiyaa miishshaanne katsaa yarshshoo zarggaa taani immana. Taani ha ubbaakka new immana» yaageedda.
