013	1CH	029	030	I woot mooddeeddenttonne I waaneedda wolk'k'aama asaakko, I haneeddabay, Israa'eeliyaa asaynne heeraan de'iyaa kawutetsatuu ubbay haneeddabay he mas'aafatuwan s'aafetti utteedda.
