014	2CH	003	004	Geeshsha Golliyaa geliyaa sa'aan de'iyaa baranddaa gomppay Geeshsha Golliyaa gomppaakka keeshshaa laatamu wad'aa; geesay laatamu wad'aa. Aa gidduwaa geeshsha work'k'aan sheeshsheedda. 3:4 Laatamu wad'aa: Ibraawetsuu itti s'eetanne laatamu wad'aa gee.
