014	2CH	003	009	Unttunttu go'etteedda misimaarii ichcheshu s'eetanne laappun tammu giraame work'k'aappe med'etteedda. Pook'iyaan de'iyaa kifiletuwaakka work'k'aan sheeshsheedda.
014	2CH	003	010	Solomone Ubbaappe Aad'd'iyaa Geeshsha Sa'aan laa"u kiruubetuwaa misiletuwaa massi giigissiide, work'k'aan sheeshsheedda.
