014	2CH	003	012	Laa"entso kiruubiyaw koyro k'efii ichcheshu wad'aa gidiide, Geeshsha Golliyaa godaa bochchee; laa'entso k'efiikka ichcheshu wad'aa gidiide, koyro kiruubiyaa k'efiyaa bochchee.
014	2CH	003	013	Ha laa"u kiruubetuwaa k'efii mic'etteedda, laatamu wad'aa gideedda; unttunttu barenttu deemuwaa Geeshsha Sa'aakko zaariide, barenttu gediyaan ek'k'eeddinno.
