016	NEH	005	003	Haratuu k'ay, «Nuuna gakkeedda iita koshaappe nuuna ashshiyaa k'umaa demmana giidde, nu goshshay, nu woyniyaa turaa sa'aynne nu keetsay attenan asaw oytseeddo» yaageeddino.
016	NEH	005	004	Haratuukka k'ay hawaadan yaageeddino; «Nu goshshawunne nu woyniyaa turaa saatoo kaatii oochcheedda giiraa c'igganaw miishshaa tal"iyaa akkeeddo.
