016	NEH	013	013	Taani k'eesiyaa Sheleemiyaa, s'aafiyaa S'aadook'anne Leewiyaa Padaaya miishshaa wotsiyaa golliyaw kaappuwaa ootsaade suntsaad. K'ay Mataaniyaa na'aa na'aa Zakkuura na'ay Hanaani unttuntta maaddiyaawaa. Hawanttu ubbaykka koshshiyaawaa ubbaa barenttu ishatoo shaakki shaakki immiyaawan ammanettiyaawantta gideeddino.
