020	PRO	027	018	Balasiyaa giyaa mitsatto ishalissiide naageedda uray I ayifiyaa maana; barena ayisseeddaawaa kabboyiyaa k'oomay bonchchettana.
020	PRO	027	019	Haatsay masttootiyaadan som"uwaa bessiyaawaadan, asaa wozanay izaaw eeshshaa bessee.
020	PRO	027	020	Hayk'uunne bashshay kalli erikkino; hewaadankka, asaa ayfii kallenna.
020	PRO	027	021	Biraynne work'k'ay taman paac'ettiide geeyiyaawaadan, asaykka bare akkiyaa galatan paac'ettee.
020	PRO	027	022	Booza asaa katsanna udulan yeggaade, udula mitsan c'addintto, aappe boozatetsay kichchenna.
020	PRO	027	023	Ne dorssatuu de'iyaa hanotaa loytsaade era; ne mehiyaa wudiyaakka wozanaappe heemma.
020	PRO	027	024	Ayaw gooppe, duretetsay med'inaw de'enna; kallachchaykka yeletaappe yeletaw aad'd'ennan agganaw danddayee.
020	PRO	027	025	Mela maatay buuc'etteeddawaappe, aac'a maatay keseeddawaappenne deriyaa bollan de'iyaa maatay shiik'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan,
