020	PRO	027	027	Attiyaa deeshshatuwaa maatsay new, ne soo asawunne ne mac'c'a k'oomatoo k'uma gidanawaa.
020	PRO	028	001	Iitatuu ooninne yederssennan bak'atiino; shin s'illotuu gaammuwaa mala s'ala.
020	PRO	028	002	Itti kawutetsay makkalanchcha gidooppe, Aa mooddiyaawanttu laametti laametti mooddino. Shin kaaletsiyaawanttu aad'd'eeda eranchchaanne akeekanchcha gidiyaa wode, mino gidiide, daro wodiyaa takkee.
020	PRO	028	003	Hiyyeesatuwaa uk'k'unniyaa daannay katsaa d'ayissiyaa wolk'k'aama iraa mala.
020	PRO	028	004	Higgiyaa bonchchenna uray bayzzanchchaa sabbee; shin higgiyaa bonchchiyaawe bayzzanchchatuwaa k'ofaa p'alk'k'ee.
020	PRO	028	005	Iita asatoo suure pirddaabay gelenna; shin Med'inaa Godaw goyinniyaawanttoo ubbabaykka gelee.
020	PRO	028	006	Geella asaa gidiide, dure gidiyaawaappe suure asaa gidiide, hiyyeesaa gidiyaawe keeka.
020	PRO	028	007	Higgiyaa naagiyaa wodallay akeekanchcha. Shin patsenna shufurotuwaanna zuppetiyaawe bare aawuwaa yeellayee.
020	PRO	028	008	Miishshaa dichchaw immiyaawaaninne yeluwaan durettiyaa Asay he mas'uwaa hiyyeesatoo keekkiyaa asaw shiishshee.
020	PRO	028	009	Higgiyaa sisanaappe giide, bare haytsaa wora zaariyaa uraa woosay S'oossaa sheneyiyaawaa.
020	PRO	028	010	Suuretuwaa iita ogiyaa kaaletsiyaa uray bare bookkeedda ollaan barew kunddana; shin geeshsha Asay lo"obaa laattana.
020	PRO	028	011	Dure Asay barena aad'd'eeda eranchcha giide k'oppee; shin akeekay de'iyaa hiyyeesay Aa paac'c'ee.
020	PRO	028	012	S'illotuu s'ooneedda wode, Asay ubbay nashettee; shin iitatuu maataa oyk'k'eedda wode, Asay k'osettee.
020	PRO	028	013	Bare nagaraa gentsiyaa uray aac'enna; shin paas'iyaawenne nagaraa aggiyaawe maarettanawaa.
020	PRO	028	014	Med'inaa Godaw ubbaa gede yayyiyaa Asay anjjetteedawaa; shin bare wozanaa guzuntsiyaa Asay metuwaan gelana.
020	PRO	028	015	Hiyyeesaa asaa mooddiyaa iita daannay gudiyaa gaammuwaanne koshateedda babark'k'iyaa mala.
020	PRO	028	016	Wozani pac'c'eedda daannay bare asaa naak'k'ee; shin asaa naak'k'iyaawaa is's'iyaawe daro laytsaa mooddana.
020	PRO	028	017	Asaa wod'eedda Asay hayk'k'ana gakkanaw bak'atiidde de'ee; Aa ooninne shiishshi akkena.
020	PRO	028	018	Borii bayinnan hamettiyaa uray k'ohettennan attanawaa; shin geella Asay itti kutsan kunddana.
020	PRO	028	019	Bare gadiyaa ootsiyaa uray katsaa kallee. Shin shufurotuwaa kaalliyaa uray ubbaa gede hiyyeesiide de'ee.
020	PRO	028	020	Ammanetteeda uray daro anjjettana; shin durettanaw jaamiyaawe murettenan attena.
020	PRO	028	021	Shaakkiide maaddiyaawe lo"enna; shin Asay guutsa ukitsaa diraw giidekka, balabaa ootsiino.
020	PRO	028	022	Uuzetiyaa uray durettanaw jaamee; barena hiyyeesatetsay oyk'k'anawaakka erenna.
020	PRO	028	023	Asaa c'oo sabbiyaa uraappe seeriyaa uray guyyeppe galatettee.
020	PRO	028	024	Bare aawuwaappenne bare aattippe wuu"iide, «Taani ayinne nagaraa ootsabeykke» yaagiyaa uraynne bayzziyaa uray itti mala.
020	PRO	028	025	Uuzetiyaa uray walassaa dentsee; shin Med'inaa Godaan ammanettiyaawe kallee.
020	PRO	028	026	Barenan ammanettiyaa Asay booza; shin aad'd'eeda eratetsan hamettiyaawe saro de'ee.
020	PRO	028	027	Hiyyeesaw immiyaa uraw pac'c'enna; shin unttuntta be'anaappe giide c'iilimmiyaawe shek'aa akkana.
020	PRO	028	028	Iita asatuu suntsettiyaa wode, Asay k'osettee; shin unttunttu d'ayiyaa wode, s'illotuu c'orattiino.
020	PRO	029	001	Daro gede seerina is's'iide, morggii d'uleedda uray hassayennan me"ana; he uraw pas'uukka baawa.
020	PRO	029	002	S'illo asatuu suntsettiyaa wode Asay nashettee; shin iitatuu biittaa mooddiyaa wode Asay oolee.
020	PRO	029	003	Aad'd'eeda eraa dosiyaa Asay bare aawuwaa nashechchee; shin woshummiyaa mac'c'a asatuwaa heeraan yuuyyiyaa Asay bare miishshaa wurssee.
020	PRO	029	004	Tumuwaa pirddiyaa kaatii bare kawutetsaa woppu ootsee; shin mattaayiyaa maanaw yoratiyaawe bare kawutetsaa bayzzee.
020	PRO	029	005	Bare shooruwaa sabbiide haasayiyaa uray, Aa gediyaw gitiyaa yeggee.
020	PRO	029	006	Iita Asay gitii oyk'k'iyaawaadan, bare nagaran oyk'ettee; shin s'illo Asay nashettanawunne yes's'anaw danddayee.
020	PRO	029	007	S'illo Asay hiyyeesaa maataa bonchchee; shin iita Asay hewaa mala eraa ubbakka erenna.
020	PRO	029	008	K'iliic'iyaawanttu kataman walassaa dentsiino; shin aad'd'eeda eranchcha asatuu hank'k'uwaa irs's'isiino.
020	PRO	029	009	Aad'd'eeda eranchcha Asay booza asaa pirdda golle afooppe, boozay hank'k'etteenne k'id'ee; aw yaatooppe saruu d'ayee.
020	PRO	029	010	Suutsaa gussanaw jaamiyaa asatuu suure asaa is's'iino; k'ay s'illo asaakka wod'anaw koyiino.
020	PRO	029	011	Booza Asay bare hank'k'uwaa yeddi bessee; shin aad'd'eeda era Asay bare hank'k'uwaa mittee.
020	PRO	029	012	Itti suntsetteedda uray wordduwaa oduwaa akkooppe, Aa oosanchchatuu ubbay iita kesiino.
020	PRO	029	013	Hiyyeesaynne asaa naak'k'iyaa Asay ittibaa kos's'iino; unttunttu laa"ookka ayifiyaa Med'inaa Goday s'eelissee.
020	PRO	029	014	Itti kaatii hiyyeesaw suure pirddooppe, I bare kawutetsan gam"ana.
020	PRO	029	015	K'ayis'eeriinne seeray naanaatoo aad'd'eedda eraa immee; shin yedan dic'c'eedda na'ay bare aato kawushshee.
020	PRO	029	016	Iita asatuu dariyaa wode, nagaray daree; shin s'illotuu unttunttu kunddetsaa be'ana.
020	PRO	029	017	Ne na'aa seera; yaatooppe, I new saruwaa immana; I neena nashshechchana.
020	PRO	029	018	S'oossay kaaletsiyaa kaalesuwaa akkena derii yeda; shin higgiyaa naagiyaa uray anjjetteedawaa.
020	PRO	029	019	K'oomay c'o odo s'alan seeretti erenna; oduu aw gelinttokka I azazettena.
020	PRO	029	020	Elleellee elleellee haasayiyaa uraa be'a erayishsha? Aappe booza uraw sintsanaw daro hidootay de'ee.
020	PRO	029	021	Ne k'oomaw na'atetsaappee doommina, I koyiyaawaa ubbaa aw imma meezeyooppe, itti gallassi new de'iyaawaa ubbaa akkanaw I kajjeelanawe attena.
020	PRO	029	022	Hank'k'etiyaa Asay walassaa dentsetsee; elle yilotiyaa Asay daro nagaraa ootsee.
020	PRO	029	023	Otoruu asaa kawushshee; shin hokkiyaa ayyaanay de'iyaa Asay bonchchetee.
020	PRO	029	024	Kayisuwaanna shaakkiyaa uray barena is's'iyaa asaa; I dabaaban tumuwaa odooppekka muretee; tumuwaa odana d'ayooppe k'ay, S'oossay Aa murana.
020	PRO	029	025	Asaw yayyiyaawe he uraw p'ire gidee; shin Med'inaa Godaan ammanettiyaa Asay saro de'ee.
