020	PRO	030	020	Woshumiyaa mishirata haniyaa hanuukka hewaa mala. Aa muussaa maw; shin meeddawaappe guyyiyaan, bare doonaa k'uc'c'a diggaade, «Taani ayinne bayzzabeykke» yaagaw.
