025	LAM	004	001	P'ooliyaa work'k'ay bare malaa waaniide taseeddee. Geeshsha work'k'ay waaniide malaa d'ayeedde. Geeshsha Gollii kees'etteedda shuchchay katamatuwaa ogiyaa ubbaa doonaan laaletti utteedda.
