027	DAN	006	015	He wode asatuu ittippe kaatiyaakko biide, «Kaatiyaw, Meedoonatuwaanne Parssetuwaa higgiyaadan gidooppe, kaatii awaayeedda awaayuu woy azazeedda azazuu laamettennawaa new era» yaageeddino.
