035	HAB	002	019	Mitsaappe masetteeddawaa ‹Beegotta!› giyaawoo, k'ay shuchchaappe masetteedda duudiyaa, ‹Dendda ek'k'a!› giyaawoo, new aayye ana! I won new ayentto k'onc'c'issanaw danddayii? Be'a, I work'k'aaninne biran sheeshsheeddawaa; aw shemppuu baawa.
