036	ZEP	003	004	Izin nabatuu otoranchchanne genanchcha. Izi k'eesatuu kka geeshshabaa tunissiyaawantta; k'ay unttunttu S'oossaa higgiyaa barenttoo injjetiyaawaadan, mirk'k'iide biliino.
