041	MAR	015	001	Wontta guuran ellekka k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu c'imatuwaannannee Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawaanttunna hewaan shiik'eedda Ayihuda shanggatuwaa ubbaanna mak'k'ettiide, Yesuusa k'achchi afiide, P'ilaas'oosaw aatsiide immeeddino.
