041	MAR	016	018	Unttunttu shooshshaa oyk'k'oopekka, woy ayaanne wod'iyaa marzziyaa ushinttokka unttuntta k'ohenna. K'ay unttunttu barenttu kushiyaa hargganchchatuwaa bolla wotsana; he hargganchchatuu pas'ana» yaageedda.
