049	EPH	004	002	Ubbaa wode hintte hintte huup'iyaa kawushshiyaawantta, ashikketuwaanne danddayanchchatuwaa gidite; ittuu ittuwaa maaddiyaawaan hintte siik'uwaa bessite.
