051	COL	001	023	Hewe hinttenttu tumu ammanuwaan min ek'k'iide, mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa sisiide, sintsaappe akkana geeddawaappe k'aas's'ennan minniide de'ooppe hanana; he wonggalaa mishiraachchuu sa'aan de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaa matan odetteedda. Taani P'awuloosikka mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa odiyaawaa gidaaddi.
051	COL	001	024	Taani hinttenttoo waayetteedda diraw, ha"i nashettay; Kiristtoosi bare huup'ew, hewaa giyaawe woosa gollew, waayettishin pac'c'eeddawaa taani ta bollaa sakuwaan kuntsay.
051	COL	001	025	S'oossay taana hinttentta maaddiyaawaanne Aa k'aalaa polaade odiyaa k'oomatetsaa kiitaa taw immeedda.
