062	1JO	002	027	Shin Kiristtoosi hintte bolla bare Geeshsha Ayaanaa gusseedda. Geeshsha Ayyaanay hinttenan de'iyaa diraw, ooninne hinttena tamaarissana koshshenna; ayaw gooppe, Aa Geeshsha Ayyaanay hinttena ubbabaa tamaarissee. I tamaarissiyaawe tumuwaappe attin wordduwaa gidenna. Hewaa diraw Ayaanaa Geeshsha timirttew azazetiidde, Kiristtoosanna ittipetetsaan de'ite.
062	1JO	002	028	Ta naatoo, k'ay I k'onc'c'iyaa wode, nuuni yashshi bayinnawantta gidanaadaaninne, Aa yuussaa gallassi Aa sintsan nuuni yeellatennaadan, aanana ittippetetsaan de'ite.
062	1JO	002	029	Kiristtoosi s'illo gidiyaawaa hintte erooppe, s'illobaa ootsiyaa ubbay S'oossaa na'aa gidiyaawaa eranaw bessee.
