062	1JO	004	003	K'ay Kiristtoosi asaa gidiide yeeddawaa ammanay geenawaa ayyaanay ubbay S'oossaappe yibeenna; aan Kiristtoosa ek'ettiyaa ayyaanay de'ee. Hintte hewe yaanawaa kase siseeddita; I haray atto ha"ikka ha alamiyaan de'ee.
